Yes, but...  As has already been mentionned, you don't want to
pray too often.  My experience is that if I don't pray for any
other reason, it's safe to pray when I reach weak.  If I pray
for some other reason, and don't have food, I'm likely to have
problems.  And food poisoning is easy to avoid: just don't eat
things that you didn't see die immediately before.  (And don't
eat things that are already dead before you kill them, e.g.
zombies---one classic error is to be blind, kill something, then
feel a dwarf corpse on the floor (where there wasn't one before)
and eat it.  And have it turn out that what you'd killed was a
dwarf zombie.)

